WEBVTT

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:38.670
Why is she here?

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:39.710
No clue...

00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:44.510
That's the clumsy person who got eaten at the beach!

00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:46.340
It took you <i>that</i> long?

00:01:47.180 --> 00:01:49.510
Ow...

00:01:49.510 --> 00:01:50.430
Good morning!

00:01:51.180 --> 00:01:55.310
We thought you ran away. What are you doing here?

00:01:57.310 --> 00:02:02.320
Surprised? The Warrior of Love, Naoe Kanetsugu, is now going to use this location as her base of operations-

00:02:05.190 --> 00:02:07.900
Why did Onii-sama make you assault Muneakira?

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:11.070
Why can Onii-sama control that familiar?!

00:02:11.490 --> 00:02:14.450
How much does Onii-sama know about us?!

00:02:14.870 --> 00:02:17.160
Hurry up and spit it out!

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:22.790
She seems like an underling.

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:25.340
I am not an underling!

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:26.880
But still...

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:29.180
It doesn't seem like you know anything...

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:32.430
You <i>did</i> fail the mission you were given, too.

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:34.430
The underling of all underlings.

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:36.640
No, she's not an underling!

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:40.060
She's a pawn.

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:43.020
I'm amazed you even know that word.

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:47.030
Yesterday, Yukki said that Kanetsugu is a clumsy pawn.

00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:49.530
I am <i>not</i> clumsy nor a pawn!

00:02:50.030 --> 00:02:52.820
I threw away Tokugawa Yoshihiko.

00:02:52.820 --> 00:02:55.620
I can't let you misunderstand that part.

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:58.290
It seems like she's truly clumsy.

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:05.420
Anyway! From today on, I will be keeping watch over the sex-crazed demon, Yagyuu Muneakira!

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:07.630
Here?!

00:03:07.630 --> 00:03:08.970
Of course.

00:03:08.970 --> 00:03:10.260
Goodie!

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:11.340
I'm against it.

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:15.600
I can't let such a dangerous person near Ohii-sama.

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:19.430
It's not that I don't understand your concern...

00:03:19.770 --> 00:03:22.520
But what Kanetsugu says is probably not a lie.

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:26.940
Of course! I hate jellyfish and lies!

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:30.450
She's a nitwit, after all. She can't perform such clever tricks.

00:03:30.450 --> 00:03:33.160
But if something happened to Ohii-sama...

00:03:33.160 --> 00:03:34.530
Don't worry.

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:40.080
I'm already a master samurai. I can protect myself even without you.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:41.250
But...

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:44.630
Calm down. When things get rough, I'll be the one protecting you.

00:03:44.630 --> 00:03:48.920
Onii-chan, please! Jyuubei will take care of her.

00:03:49.710 --> 00:03:53.760
This one barks pretty well, so we could at least use her as a guard dog.

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:56.180
What's with this dog treatment?

00:03:56.180 --> 00:04:00.180
Jyuubei will feed her and take her on walks too!

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:02.140
All right, fine.

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:03.690
Whoopie!

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:05.730
Good for you, Gutsugutsu-san!

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:09.030
Gutsugutsu? What is that, a boiling pot?

00:04:09.030 --> 00:04:11.070
It's your nickname, Gutsugutsu-san.

00:04:11.070 --> 00:04:13.570
It's kind of difficult to say Naoe Tsugutsugu, isn't it?

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:16.160
They're both wrong!

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:19.080
It's Kanetsugu!

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:26.420
Well then, let's end the stupidity and get to the main point.

00:04:26.420 --> 00:04:28.460
You were able to analyze that data?

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:31.920
Of course, with my skills it was easy...

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:36.260
Though I am lacking a little sleep.

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:41.600
These were in Onii-sama's files?

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:43.890
Though they're only fragments.

00:04:43.890 --> 00:04:48.360
While copying them from the server at the villa, most of the data was destroyed.

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:51.440
This is how much I've managed to restore.

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:57.570
"Demon God: The one whose name shall not be uttered..."

00:04:57.570 --> 00:04:59.240
What's this about?

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:00.540
I don't know.

00:05:01.490 --> 00:05:06.790
But Tokugawa Yoshihiko has to be planning something devious.

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:10.500
This audio clip is the most disturbing of them all.

00:05:20.850 --> 00:05:23.980
What was that creepy voice?

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:25.770
Yoshihiko-sama's voice...?

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:28.190
No, it's not Onii-sama's voice.

00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:29.270
I know it.

00:05:30.110 --> 00:05:31.110
Jyuubei-san?

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:34.280
I know that voice.

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:35.780
Really, Jyuubei?

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:36.990
Where did you hear it?

00:05:36.990 --> 00:05:38.320
Whose voice is it?

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:38.990
Awaken
Jyuubei-san?

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:39.780
Please get a hold of yourself, Jyuubei-san!

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:40.450
Your Master

00:05:40.450 --> 00:05:41.620
Please get a hold of yourself, Jyuubei-san!

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:44.830
Are you all right, Jyuubei?

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:47.370
Who is that voice?

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:53.300
I don't know!

00:05:58.050 --> 00:06:01.300
What's with that old-fashioned stumbling?

00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:04.220
You were still there?

00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:07.890
I can help you decrypt that if you wish.

00:06:07.890 --> 00:06:09.850
You can understand what it's saying?

00:06:10.730 --> 00:06:15.650
Why should I hide it? I, Naoe Kanetsugu, have passed the 4th-rank English Proficiency Examination!

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:18.240
The 4th-rank English Proficiency Exam...?

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:21.570
I thought everyone gets that in middle school...

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:23.660
Amazing!

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:28.660
Gutsugutsu-san, you're amazing! You can speak English!

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:32.210
It seems as though you finally understand how amazing I am.

00:06:32.210 --> 00:06:33.290
It's Latin.

00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:38.470
I'm saying this audio data has a pronounciation scheme similar to Latin.

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:40.550
L-Latin?

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:44.970
So, what language is that?

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:49.600
On top of that, it's encrypted.

00:06:51.310 --> 00:06:56.280
So we will assume this audio data is in Latin, and replace it with words that have the closest pronounciation.

00:06:56.280 --> 00:06:58.150
We'll put that through a translator.

00:06:58.740 --> 00:07:01.700
"The time hath reached its peak and God's land approaches."

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:04.740
"Thou shalt reform thyselves and believe in the Gospel..."

00:07:04.740 --> 00:07:08.410
It's a statement that was written in a gospel of a forbidden religion.

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:10.290
A forbidden gospel?

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:13.250
Why is that in Yoshihiko-sama's data...?

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:15.840
That's what I can't figure out...

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:19.880
Oh no, the clothes are hanging outside!

00:07:19.880 --> 00:07:22.470
You had better not get my kimono wet!

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:23.680
Yes ma'am!

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:24.800
Poke poke.

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:31.270
That hurt!

00:07:31.270 --> 00:07:32.480
Shut up!

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:37.780
What are you doing?!

00:07:37.780 --> 00:07:39.440
Will you be quiet?!

00:07:43.860 --> 00:07:45.570
Gutsugutsu-san, are you okay?

00:07:45.570 --> 00:07:47.910
Idiots won't die from just that.

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:49.330
Come on, let's continue.

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:50.450
Yes ma'am.

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:52.460
Now it'll be a little quieter.

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:55.170
Muneakira, just leave that thing alone.

00:07:55.170 --> 00:07:57.630
But we took so long to fix the wall...!

00:07:58.960 --> 00:07:59.800
It's raining...

00:08:02.970 --> 00:08:06.140
Hey! That's my cottage!

00:08:06.140 --> 00:08:07.850
Christ, you're loud.

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:09.810
Senhime-san, let's sleep here together!

00:08:09.810 --> 00:08:11.850
And why do I have to sleep in this dog house?

00:08:11.850 --> 00:08:15.810
Ohii-sama has changed quite a bit since they came here.

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:18.820
She's changed so much since then...

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:24.990
Now that I think of it, it was also raining on the day we first met.

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:26.320
Ten Years Ago

00:08:27.030 --> 00:08:33.000
This is Tokugawa Senhime-sama, who has transferred from Ooedo.

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:37.920
You are in charge of protecting Senhime-sama as of today.

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:42.720
Please stay by Senhime-sama's side from now on.

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:44.800
Y-Yes, sir!

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:51.850
Hanzou. I want you to accept another position on top of protecting Senhime-sama.

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:56.850
I want you to become Senhime-sama's friend at school.

00:08:56.850 --> 00:08:59.400
Senhime-sama's friend at school...

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:05.150
Hanzou, being the same age as her, you can become a true friend to her.

00:09:05.780 --> 00:09:07.570
That is what I believe.

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:12.240
I can... become a true friend...

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:16.370
Did you see that princess from the main lineage?

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:19.920
I got a glimpse, but she's giving off a bad aura, just like the rumors said.

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:22.510
Well, it's best to not get involved with her.

00:09:23.050 --> 00:09:23.920
This girl...

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:25.090
She's that Princess Tokugawa's...

00:09:25.590 --> 00:09:29.970
If there's something you want to say, I think you should be frank in doing so...

00:09:29.970 --> 00:09:30.510
Huh?

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:33.600
I don't think talking behind someone's back is-

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:36.520
You're thinking the same way, aren't you?

00:09:37.190 --> 00:09:38.600
I don't think-

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:40.940
Stop acting up, you're our junior!

00:09:45.030 --> 00:09:48.320
Wow, you think you can protect the princess like <i>that?</i>

00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:51.030
If you tell on us, we won't just let you get away.

00:09:51.030 --> 00:09:54.290
Let's go, she doesn't have that kind of courage anyway.

00:09:57.540 --> 00:10:00.750
At that moment, I made a decision...

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:09.680
To become stronger and protect Senhime-sama... and stand by her side, no matter what happens.

00:10:15.770 --> 00:10:18.980
Yet now, she has so many friends...

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:24.820
Perhaps my role is over as well.

00:10:34.490 --> 00:10:36.750
Let's go together, Hanzou-san!

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:38.080
J-Jyuubei-sa-

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:42.460
Today's a good day.

00:10:43.170 --> 00:10:48.010
Now that Gutsugutsu-san's living with us, things will just get even more fun!

00:10:48.010 --> 00:10:50.510
Jyuubei-san, aren't you sad?

00:10:51.470 --> 00:10:55.220
Do you not want to be with Muneakira-san alone?

00:10:57.020 --> 00:10:58.850
I do, but...

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:02.900
Jyuubei wants to do it with everyone!

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:09.900
When everyone's together, I'm happy because I get to see a lot of different sides to Onii-chan.

00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:15.200
I see.

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:17.660
That's a happy thing, right?

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:19.790
Of course.

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:23.460
Nice and warm...

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:25.380
What?

00:11:30.010 --> 00:11:31.050
Jyuubei-san!

00:11:32.050 --> 00:11:34.720
Who are you? Show yourself now!

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:38.850
You aren't getting away after doing that to Jyuubei-san!

00:11:39.390 --> 00:11:40.060
Detection Mode
Detection Mode

00:11:40.060 --> 00:11:41.600
You can't hide from me!

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:41.730
Detection Mode
You can't hide from me!

00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:41.770
You can't hide from me!

00:11:41.770 --> 00:11:41.980
Target Detected
You can't hide from me!

00:11:41.980 --> 00:11:43.730
Target Detected

00:11:43.730 --> 00:11:46.020
Wh-What in the world is that?

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:53.280
Hanzou-san, what's wrong?!

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:55.240
Muneakira-san, it's an enemy!

00:11:55.740 --> 00:11:57.490
Jyuubei-san was assaulted!

00:11:57.490 --> 00:11:58.450
What?!

00:11:58.450 --> 00:12:00.290
Are you all right, Jyuubei?!

00:12:00.290 --> 00:12:01.210
Is she hurt?

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:02.620
She's just lost consciousness.

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:04.000
The enemy!

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:05.460
Where's the enemy, Hanzou-san?

00:12:05.460 --> 00:12:09.630
I don't know, but an invisible enemy was here for sure!

00:12:10.550 --> 00:12:11.800
An invisible enemy?

00:12:13.510 --> 00:12:14.050
That voice is...

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:15.970
Matabei-san!

00:12:17.890 --> 00:12:19.270
Immovable Wall!

00:12:24.600 --> 00:12:27.230
You coward, show yourself!

00:12:27.230 --> 00:12:28.150
Yukimura!

00:12:28.150 --> 00:12:29.530
Matabei-san!

00:12:30.070 --> 00:12:31.030
Are you all right?!

00:12:32.070 --> 00:12:33.150
Matabei-san!

00:12:33.150 --> 00:12:34.530
She's just unconscious.

00:12:34.530 --> 00:12:35.610
Get in the field, hurry!

00:12:35.610 --> 00:12:37.280
Jyuubei was also hit.

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:39.030
She isn't injured, but she won't wake up!

00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:42.660
The enemy probably used a spell that won't let them wake up.

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:44.960
Yukimura, are you hurt?

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:47.290
I let down my guard because I was lacking sleep.

00:12:47.630 --> 00:12:50.380
I was able to put up this field, but...

00:12:50.380 --> 00:12:51.880
I don't know how long I can keep it up.

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:54.260
Hanzou-san, where's the enemy?

00:12:54.260 --> 00:12:56.800
I've been searching but it doesn't seem to be here.

00:12:57.760 --> 00:12:58.510
Ohii-sama!

00:12:58.970 --> 00:13:00.970
She said she was going to sleep early...

00:13:01.270 --> 00:13:03.230
Don't! It's dangerous to go alone!

00:13:12.610 --> 00:13:13.740
Ohii-sama.

00:13:13.740 --> 00:13:15.820
Hanzou, what is that?

00:13:15.820 --> 00:13:17.200
I don't know.

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:18.990
All I know is that it's an invisible enemy.

00:13:18.990 --> 00:13:20.200
An invisible enemy?

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:21.660
It's not here...

00:13:21.660 --> 00:13:24.500
Detection Mode
Detection Mode
If it was able to avoid the shuriken in an instant...

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:28.080
Even if I found it, I wouldn't be able to match its speed.
Detection Mode
Detection Mode

00:13:29.130 --> 00:13:31.210
Are you all right? Hanzou-san, Senhime-sama!

00:13:31.210 --> 00:13:32.050
Yes.

00:13:32.050 --> 00:13:33.630
What about everyone?

00:13:33.630 --> 00:13:35.470
Ambushed, some injured.

00:13:35.470 --> 00:13:36.340
Are they all right?!

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:40.260
They're being protected by Yukimura's field right now, but it won't last long.

00:13:40.260 --> 00:13:43.180
Then we just have to defeat it here.

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:45.020
Graceful Elegance!

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:57.450
Hanzou, let us know when you see the enemy.

00:13:57.450 --> 00:13:58.070
Yes, ma'am.

00:13:58.450 --> 00:14:00.950
Senhime-sama, why don't you wear the glasses?

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:01.740
It'd be of no use.

00:14:01.740 --> 00:14:04.660
Those glasses are specially made and optimized for Hanzou.

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:07.040
Here it comes!

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:09.790
There's a heat signature approaching the kitchen!

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:12.040
Now!

00:14:12.670 --> 00:14:15.090
Lightning Flash!

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:23.350
What are you doing?!

00:14:23.350 --> 00:14:24.850
Do you want to die?!

00:14:25.270 --> 00:14:28.350
I was just going to complain about keeping me awake...

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:29.440
Ohii-sama, please move away!

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:31.440
She may be the enemy!

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:34.320
You're still doubting her?

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:35.820
How horrible!

00:14:35.820 --> 00:14:38.070
Wait, why are you doubting me?

00:14:39.200 --> 00:14:41.370
There's no way this girl would be the mastermind.

00:14:41.370 --> 00:14:43.030
B-But...

00:14:43.780 --> 00:14:46.080
Behind you, Ohii-sama!

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:50.250
Kanetsugu, are you hurt?

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:52.130
I-I'm all right.

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:57.300
Lightning Flash!

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:02.260
Lightning Flash
Lightning Flash

00:15:03.680 --> 00:15:04.640
Did she kill it?

00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:05.430
No...

00:15:05.930 --> 00:15:07.020
Move!

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:12.860
Everyone, go out to the courtyard!

00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:15.820
The enemy just went that way though.

00:15:15.820 --> 00:15:16.780
I have an idea.

00:15:16.780 --> 00:15:17.440
Believe in me!

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:18.690
Hey, Muneakira!

00:15:18.690 --> 00:15:20.700
Ohii-sama, please wait!

00:15:21.570 --> 00:15:23.370
Please wait for me!

00:15:23.990 --> 00:15:26.240
We're going towards the enemy? Are you high?

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:28.790
I saw it for just a moment.

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:32.790
The enemy's form came up from the deflected rain.

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:35.670
I see, if we can see it then there's no problem.

00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:38.090
I found the enemy!

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:40.220
It's smart.

00:15:40.220 --> 00:15:43.390
It's staying at a safe distance, waiting for the rain to stop.

00:15:43.390 --> 00:15:45.850
There will be no chance of winning once the rain stops.

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:47.970
Besides, Yukimura-san's field won't last.

00:15:47.970 --> 00:15:49.560
What should we do?!

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:51.480
The rain might stop!

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:52.560
Hanzou.

00:15:53.440 --> 00:15:55.150
Kiss Muneakira.

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:57.440
Why such a lewd act right now?!

00:15:57.440 --> 00:15:58.530
Shut up!

00:15:58.940 --> 00:16:02.150
Once the rain stops, you'll be the only one who can see that enemy.

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:03.280
But...

00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:05.070
To defeat that thing...

00:16:05.570 --> 00:16:08.200
Hanzou-san has to become a master samurai.

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:10.700
Let's kiss.

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:16.750
I'll be able to protect Ohii-sama if I become a master samurai...

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:19.880
We don't have time to dawdle around, hurry up and kiss Muneakira.

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:20.800
Yes, ma'am!

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:24.050
Do it while I can still see the enemy...

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:25.930
Hanzou-san... here we go.

00:16:25.930 --> 00:16:26.760
All right.

00:16:36.690 --> 00:16:38.770
A-Actually...

00:16:39.070 --> 00:16:40.480
No!

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:49.120
I'm sorry Muneakira-san, but Ohii-sama is the only general for me!

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:50.910
What the hell are you doing, idiot!

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:53.540
Why are you babbling in the middle of a fight?!

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:55.460
If you keep screwing around, the enemy will-

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:58.250
This isn't good, the rain's stopped!

00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:01.050
Watch out, Muneakira-san!

00:17:04.630 --> 00:17:05.800
Muneakira!

00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:07.680
My cottage!

00:17:07.680 --> 00:17:08.300
Get out of the way!

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:12.430
Ohii-sama, it's not here anymore.

00:17:13.980 --> 00:17:16.480
Muneakira, Muneakira! Get a hold of yourself!

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:19.820
What should we do? The kiss machine died!

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:21.320
He's just unconscious.

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:24.150
If you keep kidding around, I'll kill <i>you!</i>

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:27.490
Muneakira please, wake up!

00:17:27.490 --> 00:17:28.410
Muneakira!

00:17:28.820 --> 00:17:32.830
What are we going to do? Now you can't become a master samurai!

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:35.620
I have to do something...

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:37.500
Yes,

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:40.210
that day I decided in my heart...

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:41.960
I'll become strong...

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:45.300
No matter what, I'll protect Ohii-sama...

00:17:45.720 --> 00:17:48.010
I'll protect Senhime-sama!

00:17:48.760 --> 00:17:51.350
Lesser being that hides in the shadows...

00:17:51.350 --> 00:17:55.890
I will not allow further absurdity in front of Senhime-sama!

00:17:55.890 --> 00:17:57.100
Hanzou, what are you doing?

00:17:58.730 --> 00:18:01.400
I will put my life on the line to defeat you!

00:18:01.400 --> 00:18:05.320
Get back, Hanzou! You must not move away from me!

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:11.240
Ohii-sama, I will stop it here.

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:13.700
Please kill it.

00:18:21.290 --> 00:18:21.750
Spiral Chains
Spiral Chains

00:18:21.750 --> 00:18:23.050
Spiral Chains!
Spiral Chains
Spiral Chains

00:18:33.310 --> 00:18:35.180
You fell for it.

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:40.190
I may not be able to hurt you, but I can stop you!

00:18:41.310 --> 00:18:42.440
Hanzou!

00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:48.200
Ohii-sama, now!

00:18:48.200 --> 00:18:52.320
Slice the enemy with me!

00:18:53.240 --> 00:18:55.740
What are you saying?! I can't do that!

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:57.000
You're my-

00:18:57.000 --> 00:19:00.670
You don't need someone guarding you anymore!

00:19:01.830 --> 00:19:02.580
Hanzou...

00:19:02.580 --> 00:19:07.010
Please... Ohii-sama, there's no more time!

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:10.010
What are you going to do?!

00:19:10.010 --> 00:19:13.140
Kanetsugu, you're helping me!

00:19:13.140 --> 00:19:14.430
Are you really...?

00:19:14.970 --> 00:19:16.560
Ohii-sama,

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:17.560
I was...

00:19:18.020 --> 00:19:18.980
I was...

00:19:19.430 --> 00:19:23.980
I was very happy to serve you...

00:19:29.650 --> 00:19:31.070
Kanetsugu, now!

00:19:37.950 --> 00:19:38.790
I can see it!

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:40.540
Blasting Flash!

00:19:52.340 --> 00:19:53.680
Hanzou!

00:19:55.300 --> 00:19:57.390
Hanzou, get a hold of yourself.

00:19:58.220 --> 00:19:59.600
Ohii-sama...

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:03.600
You wouldn't be able to tell which one's the guard now...

00:20:05.770 --> 00:20:08.530
You total idiot!

00:20:09.480 --> 00:20:13.320
You're not that worthless of an existence to me.

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:15.280
Since that day ten years ago...!

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:21.040
Ohii-sama...

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:25.080
What am I supposed to do if you go away?

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:27.420
Who's going to save me?

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:29.170
Who's going to protect me?

00:20:29.760 --> 00:20:32.510
Who's going to be my friend?!

00:20:33.090 --> 00:20:35.470
Try doing the same thing again.

00:20:36.140 --> 00:20:37.430
I won't let you get away with it.

00:20:38.760 --> 00:20:41.850
Yes, ma'am. I'm very sorry.

00:20:42.560 --> 00:20:46.060
Sheesh, what's their relationship with each other?

00:20:46.060 --> 00:20:47.770
A general and warrior,

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:51.400
and perhaps best friends.

00:20:51.400 --> 00:20:52.570
You revived!

00:20:53.700 --> 00:20:55.660
The spell broke.

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:58.030
It's thanks to those two defeating the enemy.

00:20:58.780 --> 00:20:59.790
Three!

00:20:59.790 --> 00:21:03.580
Without my help, we wouldn't have won!

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:04.710
Really?

00:21:04.710 --> 00:21:06.170
Onii-chan!

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:06.710
Jyuubei!

00:21:06.710 --> 00:21:07.750
Yukimura!

00:21:07.750 --> 00:21:08.630
Matabei-san!

00:21:10.550 --> 00:21:12.960
Whoa, Jyuubei's doggy house is gone!

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:15.760
No, I am my cottage!

00:21:15.760 --> 00:21:18.090
Wow, you can speak English!

00:21:18.090 --> 00:21:19.720
That was incorrect...

00:21:19.720 --> 00:21:20.850
Yes, we can!

00:21:20.850 --> 00:21:22.140
Shut up!

00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:25.190
Can't you guys be quiet? It's a nice scene!

00:21:25.190 --> 00:21:26.520
Hanzou, kill them all.

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:28.400
What? But I'm hurt-

00:21:28.400 --> 00:21:30.570
You can't follow my orders?!

00:23:12.040 --> 00:23:14.540
How many functions do your glasses have, Hanzou-san?

00:23:14.540 --> 00:23:16.090
About 300, I suppose.

00:23:16.090 --> 00:23:16.550
That many?!

00:23:16.550 --> 00:23:22.050
It has zoom, heat vision, and night vision, of course. But it can also do searches and scout the power level of enemies.

00:23:22.050 --> 00:23:26.680
On top of that it has a digital camera, a GPS, <i>and</i> blocks 99% of UV rays!

00:23:26.680 --> 00:23:27.890
But doesn't it cost a lot?

00:23:27.890 --> 00:23:31.060
But wait! You can get these now for <i>only</i> 19800 yen, including shipping and handling!

00:23:31.060 --> 00:23:33.360
And, the Tokugawa household will pay the tax!

00:23:33.360 --> 00:23:34.610
Jyuubei wants one too!

00:23:34.610 --> 00:23:37.190
Next Time, Hyakka Ryouran: Slave of Kisses.

00:23:37.190 --> 00:23:40.070
It's late at night, so please make sure you don't dial the wrong number.
